# Amazon Clone currently runs entirely in the browser as a static site.
# No environment variables are read by index.html, amazone.css, or amazone.js.
#
# Do not add real credentials, API keys, access tokens, database URLs,
# payment secrets, or personal data to this file.
#
# If a future backend is introduced:
# 1. Document each required variable and its purpose.
# 2. Provide safe, non-secret example values only.
# 3. Store real values in the deployment platform's secret manager.
# 4. Never expose privileged values to browser JavaScript.
#
# Current runtime configuration: none.
